From: E200 FPV Builder <builder@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] Enable E200 Realtek PHY for xilinx-v2022.2

AXI Ethernet and Xilinx DMA are already enabled in this pinned upstream
configuration. Add only the missing Realtek PHY selection.

---
--- a/arch/arm/configs/xilinx_zynq_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm/configs/xilinx_zynq_defconfig
@@ -109,4 +109,5 @@
 CONFIG_XILINX_AXI_EMAC=y
 CONFIG_MARVELL_PHY=y
+CONFIG_REALTEK_PHY=y
 CONFIG_VITESSE_PHY=y
 CONFIG_MDIO_BITBANG=y
